sbase/printf — minimalist printf(1) from sbase
Source: https://git.suckless.org/sbase/
License: MIT
Retrieved: 2026-03-20

Local patches:
- test_sbase_printf.c: FerrugoCC test harness (exit 42 on success)
- printf_util.h: minimal subset of utf.h + util.h for printf only
  (no regex.h, reduced libutf — skips %b/%c rune handling)

Files from upstream (unmodified except include paths):
- printf.c (main not used — test driver exercises format logic directly)
- unescape.c (libutil)
- ealloc.c (libutil)
- strtonum.c (libutil)
- estrtod.c (libutil)
